    "proseDraft": "The meeting consisted of stated remarks about pricing changes and related updates. No items are listed as confirmed and no items are listed as unresolved.\n\nStated in the meeting\n- It was stated that Starter goes from twelve to fifteen and Team from twenty-nine to thirty-two.\n- It was asked whether enterprise stays as contact us.\n- Someone said yes.\n- Someone said they will build the pricing update on a branch and send a preview link on Monday.\n- It was stated that the pricing update is live on the 13th and Jun owns it.\n- Someone affirmed that it is live on the 13th.\n- Someone said they will update the sales deck to match.\n- It was stated that the FAQ still says prices are locked for a year, which is no longer true for monthly plans.\n- Someone said they will rewrite that answer.\n- Someone said to send the new copy and they will swap it in.\n- Someone said to send the new copy and they will swap it in.\n- Someone said they will do it.\n- It was stated that the URL will not change, so old links keep working."
